---
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Atmofrost · About"
  page="about"
  description="The people decide what gets built. Atmofrost brings it to the people."
>
  <div class="af-prose">
    <p class="lead">
      Atmofrost Inc. is a Delaware C-Corporation founded to facilitate
      expansion.
    </p>

    <p>
      The goal was to maintain our established presence in the world and
      preserve our moral good, whilst creating a legal entity that could help us
      scale swiftly.
    </p>

    <p>
      Public facing matters should not involve Atmofrost, and Atmofrost should
      not impact vice versa.
    </p>

    <p>
      Our goal is to create services that individuals actually need in the
      world, ensure people know about it, and make sure it stays living.
    </p>

    <p>
      Time and time again we have seen that products can be made without harming
      others. In fact, this often results in a better product for all.
    </p>

    <p>
      Each design and line of code is reviewed thoroughly and vetted by
      various people in our team before publishing to the world.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
